  "display_title": "A Beginner's Guide to Hiding Zombies",
  "description": "After a carriage accident leaves her family in (literal) pieces, Emily Walker is desperate to bring her brothers and twin sister back. With the help of a demon cat named Lev and a dabble in dark magic, she succeeds — but something isn’t right. The Walker siblings are cold, weak, and, well... dead. Now that her siblings are zombies, Emily faces a new challenge: keeping House Walker’s secret safe from the evils that await. How can she hold her family together when it seems destined to fall apart?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
